### Activity Tests ###

### 1. 创建用户并设置时区（如果还没有）
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($input: UpdateUserInput!) { updateUser(input: $input) { success user { id timezone } } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "timezone": "Asia/Dubai"
    }
  }
}

### 2. 创建活动（用户本地时间 15:00）
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($input: CreateActivityInput!) { createActivity(input: $input) { success activity { id name category scheduledDatetime status userId } } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "name": "测试活动",
      "category": "social",
      "userId": 1,
      "scheduledDatetime": "2025-01-11T21:00:00.000Z" 
    }
  }
}

### 3. 查询活动详情（验证时间是否正确存储）
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "query($id: Int!) { activity(id: $id) { success activity { id name scheduledDatetime status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 20
  }
}

### 4. 更新活动时间（改为当地时间 16:00）
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($id: Int!, $input: UpdateActivityInput!) { updateActivity(id: $id, input: $input) { success activity { id name scheduledDatetime status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 20,
    "input": {
      "scheduledDatetime": "2025-01-22T16:00:00.000Z"  
    }
  }
}

### 5. 查询用户的所有活动
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
{
  "query": "query($userId: Int!) { activitiesByUserId(userId: $userId) { success activities { id name scheduledDatetime status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "userId": 1
  }
}

### 6. 创建即将过期的活动（当前时间前一天的活动）
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($input: CreateActivityInput!) { createActivity(input: $input) { success activity { id name scheduledDatetime status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "name": "即将过期的活动",
      "category": "social",
      "userId": 1,
      "scheduledDatetime": "2025-01-11T23:00:00.000Z" 
    }
  }
}

### 7. 等待活动过期（第二天凌晨）后查询状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "query($id: Int!) { activity(id: $id) { success activity { id name scheduledDatetime status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 2
  }
}

### 8. 删除活动
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($id: Int!) { deleteActivity(id: $id) { success activity { id name status } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 33

  }
}

### 测试步骤说明：

# 1. 首先运行 Redis（如果还没有运行）：
# 2. 按顺序执行测试：
# a. 运行测试 1：设置用户时区
# b. 运行测试 2：创建一个活动（记下返回的 ID）
# c. 运行测试 3：验证活动创建成功，注意 scheduledDatetime 是 ISO 8601 格式的 UTC 时间
# d. 运行测试 4：更新活动时间
# e. 运行测试 5：验证用户的所有活动
# f. 运行测试 6：创建一个即将过期的活动
# g. 等待到第二天凌晨
# h. 运行测试 7：验证活动状态是否变为 expired
# i. 运行测试 8：清理测试数据

# 预期结果：
# - 创建活动时，scheduledDatetime 必须是 ISO 8601 格式（例如：2024-01-22T15:00:00.000Z）
# - 时间字符串必须包含毫秒和 Z 后缀（表示 UTC）
# - 服务器会根据用户时区进行适当的转换
# - 返回的时间也会是 ISO 8601 格式的 UTC 时间

# 注意事项：
# 1. 替换 userId 为实际的测试用户 ID
# 2. 替换活动 ID 为实际创建的活动 ID
# 3. 确保时间字符串格式正确（YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ）
# 4. 确保 Redis 服务正在运行
# 5. 检查日志以验证过期任务的调度

### Query - Get Posts with Target Filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "query($targetType: String, $targetId: Int, $currentUserId: Int, $unreadOnly: Boolean, $category: String, $skip: Int, $take: Int) { posts(targetType: $targetType, targetId: $targetId, currentUserId: $currentUserId, unreadOnly: $unreadOnly, category: $category, skip: $skip, take: $take) { success posts { id mediaUrl caption category author { id first_name last_name } } errors { field message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "targetType": "community",
    "targetId": 1,
    "currentUserId": 2,
    "unreadOnly": false,
    "skip": 0,
    "take": 10,
    "category": "workout"
  }
}

### Query - Get Only Unread Posts
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "query($currentUserId: Int!, $unreadOnly: Boolean!, $skip: Int, $take: Int) { posts(currentUserId: $currentUserId, unreadOnly: $unreadOnly, skip: $skip, take: $take) { success posts { id caption category author { id first_name last_name } post_targets { id target_type target_id } post_views { id user_id viewed_at } } errors { field message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "currentUserId": 2,
    "unreadOnly": true,
    "skip": 0,
    "take": 10
  }
}

### Query - Get Posts by Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "query": "query($category: String!, $skip: Int, $take: Int) { posts(category: $category, skip: $skip, take: $take) { success posts { id caption category author { id first_name last_name } post_targets { id target_type target_id } post_views { id user_id viewed_at } } errors { field message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "category": "workout",
    "skip": 0,
    "take": 10
  }
}

